On substantive **non-Composer-parent** code/harness ships, also include D-92 lines per `model-gates.mdc` § Default model routing: `orchestrator-model:`, `implementer-model:`, `implementer-exception:` (+ `verifier-model:`, `visual-authority:`, `model-routing-verdict:`, `composer-repair-attempt:`, `grok-takeover:`, `grok-final-verification:` when applicable).

